---
<div class="phone-frame" role="img" aria-label="PumpOS attendant handover on a phone: Suresh Kumar on DU-1 enters closing readings, HDFC POS card and UPI, and cash handed over.">
  <div class="phone-screen product-replica">
    <div class="pf-bar"><strong>PumpOS</strong><span>Suresh Kumar</span></div>
    <div class="pf-card"><small>Hilltop Fuels Kozhikode · Morning Shift</small><strong>Shift open · record as you go</strong></div>
    <div class="pf-card">
      <h5>Dispenser 1 <span>· DU-1</span></h5>
